## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Check |
|-------|-------|
| Dashboard shows no events | Is the collector running and connected? Check its console for "Connected" message. |
| "Access granted" event but relay didn't click | Check the relay wiring (see wiring.md); verify the transistor and diode are in the right positions. |
| RFID card never scans | Is the RC522 powered? (3.3V, not 5V). Is D10/D9 wired correctly? |
| Keypad presses don't show up | Are D2–D5 (rows) and D6–D8/A0 (columns) wired? Are they not shorted together? |
| PIR sensor stuck HIGH or never triggers | Wait ~1 minute after power-on for sensor warm-up. Check the sensor orientation and light levels. |
| Lockout won't end after 30 seconds | Power-cycle the Arduino — there may be a firmware issue. Re-upload the sketch. |

